  "goodToKnow": "Diplomatisch means diplomatic, both in foreign relations (diplomatische Beziehungen, der diplomatische Dienst) and in tact: diplomatisch formulieren (to phrase tactfully). Der Diplomat is a diplomat, and die Diplomatie diplomacy. Das Diplom is a degree, the old German engineering degree Diplom-Ingenieur (Dipl.-Ing.) being famous. Germans are sometimes seen as too direct, the opposite of diplomatisch."
